# Keep the build context small and hermetic. The Rust `COPY . .` would otherwise ship a
# multi-GB target/ dir, and the web stage rebuilds node_modules/build itself via `npm ci`.
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.svelte-kit
web/build
**/.git
.env
.fastembed_cache
.idea
**/.DS_Store
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
